OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUnseen Only Fools clips add depth,
OL,4,Afilmmaker says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Latto, a comedy archive
OL,7,Fspecialist who unearthed some of the
OL,8,Fmaterial, said it showed how well
OL,9,Fwritten the characters were and he
OL,10,Fhoped the scenes could be used in
OL,11,Fextended episodes.
OL,13,FHe told the BBC the Jolly Boys' Outing
OL,14,Ffootage "was absolutely amazing to
OL,15,Ffind" and he remembered watching it
OL,16,Fwith his family on Christmas Day.
